{"version":1,"key":"card:55","content":{"id":55,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令可以查看文件的内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 查看 hello.c 的文件内容\n~ » cat hello.c\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main() {\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\n    return 0;\n}","language":"bash","uuid":"3a5f860f-1be7-4632-81f7-8e38fda50140","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-n","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项来显示行号"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 查看 hello.c 的文件内容，并显示行号\n~ » cat -n hello.c\n     1  #include<stdio.h>\n     2  int main() {\n     3      printf(\"Hello World!\");\n     4      return 0;\n     5  }","language":"bash","uuid":"d6639004-a677-449f-9494-6671e88bcb79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以查看多个文件，并将其内容依次显示在屏幕上"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » cat hello.c hello.md\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main() {\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\n    return 0;\n}\n## Hello World\n\n\nThis is markdown file!","language":"bash","uuid":"e5d45fdf-63da-4634-b57f-d81bac130bea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的特点是一次性读取文件的所有的内容，然后全部显示在屏幕上，所以对于比较长的文件，我们比较难以阅读，需要滚动屏幕才可以读取到前面的内容。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相似的命令是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tac","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"cat","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 反着写就是它了，它的作用也是查看文件，不过是倒序输出的"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » tac hello.c\n}\n    return 0;\n    printf(\"Hello World!\");\nint main() {\n#include<stdio.h>","language":"Bash","uuid":"3e5f772b-43e2-4253-a5bc-170414267808","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"man tac","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了解该命令的更多信息，该命令在实际中并不常用，了解即可。"}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/cat"],"createTime":1689001716360,"updateTime":1745155423315,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155423315}}